# Vercel CLI upload rules for the Passport demo.
#
# Deployments are PREBUILT (`vercel deploy --prebuilt`), so the only tree the
# CLI ever uploads is `.vercel/output`. This file still has to exist: with no
# .vercelignore the CLI falls back to .gitignore, and .gitignore excludes
# precisely the trees the deployed demo must serve — `public/zk/**` (Compact
# proving keys) and `dist/` — because they are built locally and cannot be
# reproduced on a Vercel builder. Its presence takes .gitignore out of the
# decision entirely.
#
# The entries below only bite if someone runs a non-prebuilt `vercel deploy`.

node_modules
.env
.env.local
